1
00:00:00,579 --> 00:00:03,579
(Howard:)So I took it down to this buddy of mine
who deals with...

2
00:00:03,749 --> 00:00:07,629
(Howard:)...shall we say, the seedy underbelly
of the collectibles world.

3
00:00:07,795 --> 00:00:09,085
(Leonard:)Seedy underbelly?

4
00:00:09,255 --> 00:00:11,465
Uh, your black-market phasers...

5
00:00:11,674 --> 00:00:14,884
(Howard:)...your screen-worn Lieutenant Uhura
panties, that kind of stuff.

6
00:00:16,178 --> 00:00:17,218
[HOWARD CLEARS THROAT]

7
00:00:17,388 --> 00:00:19,138
(Raj:)Who's this mysterious buddy
you suddenly have?

8
00:00:19,307 --> 00:00:21,387
(Howard:)Just a guy. I know a guy.

9
00:00:21,559 --> 00:00:24,059
(Raj:)-Is it Eddie Crispo?
-No, I can't tell you who it is.

10
00:00:24,228 --> 00:00:27,768
(Raj:)-Who else could it be? It has to be.
-I know lots of dangerous people.

11
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,780
(Raj:)-Name one.
-Eddie Crispo.

12
00:00:31,736 --> 00:00:34,486
(Howard:)Anyway, he said this isn't a replica.

13
00:00:34,697 --> 00:00:36,277
(Howard:)It's the real deal.

14
00:00:36,449 --> 00:00:39,789
(Sheldon:)If you're suggesting that
that is the actual ring of power...

15
00:00:39,952 --> 00:00:42,162
(Sheldon:)...forged by Sauron in Mount Doom...

16
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:44,830
(Sheldon:)...I look at you with an expression
of exhaustion...

17
00:00:44,999 --> 00:00:46,499
...and ever-so-slight amusement.

18
00:00:46,667 --> 00:00:48,167
[SCOFFS]

19
00:00:50,421 --> 00:00:52,591
(Leonard:)He's not saying it's a magic ring.

20
00:00:53,132 --> 00:00:54,512
(Leonard:)You're not, are you?

21
00:00:54,967 --> 00:00:56,427
(Howard:)No, but it's close.

22
00:00:56,594 --> 00:00:58,094
(Howard:)Look at the markings inside.

23
00:00:58,262 --> 00:01:00,432
(Howard:)Those are production markings.

